                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino obo buzuba umwi muntu mu-Benjamini wakacija kuzwa kunkondo, wakasika ku-Sile, wakeza azikobela zyakwe zidelukide, alimwi kumutwe wakwe kwakali ivu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo naakasika, wakabona Eli ulikede acuuno cakwe kubbazu lyanzila, wakali kulangila, nkaambo moyo wakwe wakali kubila nkaambo kabbokesi lya-Leza. Lino muntu naakasika kumunzi akwaamba makani, munzi woonse wakalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Eli naakaswiilila cikwala cakulila wakabuzya wati, Ino ndupyopyonganonzi olu lucita cikwala? Lino oyo muntu wakafwambaana kusika akwaambila Eli makani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Eli kajisi myaaka iili makumi aali musanu mwaane aali amusanu mwaatatu yakukomena, ameso aakwe akaofwaala, takakali kukonzya kubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
