              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo oyo muntu wakaambila Eli wati, Ndime ndakazwa kunkondo, ndacija sunu kuzwa kunkondo. Lino wakabuzya wati, Makaninzi mwanaangu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela sikuleta makani wakavuwa wati, Ba-Israyeli bacija kumeso aaba-Filisti, nkaambo kwakaba luumo lupati akati kabantu, nkabela bana bako bobile bafwa, Hofeni a-Pinehasi, abbokesi lya-Leza alyalo lyanyanzigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo aambe buyo makani aabbokesi lya-Leza, Eli wakawa kusule acuuno cakwe kubbazu lyamulyango, nkabela insingo yakwe yakatyoka, wafwa, nkaambo kali mucembele, kali mulemu. Nkabela wakabeteka ba-Israyeli myaaka iili makumi one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
