            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwana wakamuulika izina lya-Ikabodi, nkaambo wakaamba kuti, Bulemu bwalonga kuzwa ku-Israyeli, nkaambo kakuti ibbokesi lya-Leza lyakanyanzigwa akaambo kawisizyala amulumaakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
